#9638=DESCRIPTIVE_REPRESENTATION_ITEM('','NOTES (UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED):1. CAD MODEL ___________ REV. __ IS REQUIRED TO   COMPLETE PRODUCT DEFINITION.2. DIRECTLY-TOLERANCED DIMENSIONS AND BASIC   DIMENSIONS DEFINED ON THE DRAWING TAKE   PRECEDENCE OVER DIMENSIONAL DATA DEFINED BY   THE MODEL. OBTAIN ALL OTHER DIMENSIONAL DATA   FROM THE MODEL. THE MODEL REPRESENTS BASIC   DIMENSIONAL DATA UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED.3. APPLICABLE STANDARDS:   ASME Y14.41-2003 APPLIES TO DATASET.   ASME Y14.5M-1994 APPLIES TO DIMENSIONING AND   TOLERANCING.4. DIMENSION AND TOLERANCE   VALUES SHOWN IN SQUARE BRACKETS   [XXX] ARE MILLIMETERS.5. MATERIAL: (.1195 THICK) 11 GA 304   SST SHT, ASTM A240.6. UNITS: INCHES');
